5qfsRjLj52n7pgis56qrZR_gDK559J0b2ANPK3niHQ&oe=6A131FB7"}, {"file_name": "SA-SG-Announce-Meta-Screenshot-2560x1440-D.png", "id": "1831264717748300", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819396_1831264721081633_334607467608416719_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lt45MgbfrEoQ7kNvwExjeU9&_nc_oc=AdqRhWxhHU8gJL0UNdRJCyfj2BKxMZNAorw5Uu35nbLZcB1wZpG_367aTAGYXN3urfo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7z9SnAzSbRum3m312_cLCkxLZpunVvw7I8MTmrIA-5AQ&oe=6A12F575"}, {"file_name": "SA-SG-Announce-Meta-Screenshot-2560x1440-E.png", "id": "787596960474525", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300574_787596963807858_7172114220445203333_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NBHXv-AC8BgQ7kNvwEeD3sZ&_nc_oc=Adok7OH2gTAmEPuWRpDrxkNoMymDcLED56W8X6OAbYrljP2NyPE_Gj4e84uGUycQIbw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4mMZFLNQCsBhfAbHhExl7yZXnizjrHhozcKxrJoIimwQ&oe=6A130EEC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SA-SG-Announce-Meta-CoverLandscape-2560x1440.png", "id": "1197972905678283", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819881_1197972909011616_3389378524631270403_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g2W1QhRVw8EQ7kNvwF3KnKF&_nc_oc=Adp040lVPSwf8yS6HnDGFbZHj_Jtlx_dmT0y4Au8Rt_mbi2usjlJgBJTV9SNSjTj_Tc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5cerlpckQ5lTnTBN6k8t8flA_8XMJ__jtFtQEDHiYl_g&oe=6A12F383"}, "display_name": "Street Gods", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Forge your path. Rewrite fate. Become a god.**\n\nStreet Gods is a physical VR action rogue-lite set in a fractured New York City, where the nine Norse realms have collided with the modern world. Ancient powers spill into the streets. Reality is falling apart. And the legendary hammer Mjolnir has chosen you.\n\n{765032712573414}\n\nDrawn into a divine conflict, you must harness the power of a god to restore what\u2019s been broken. Battle mythic enemies, uncover lost secrets, and reshape the world one run at a time.\n\n**Wield Mjolnir with real weight and force**\n\nThrow, recall and slam the hammer in fast, physical combat built for VR. Mjolnir responds directly to your hands \u2014 every strike feels heavy, precise and deliberate.\n\n{780071774460570}\n\n**Your route. Your run. Your legend.**\n\nPlan each run by placing city blocks on a mystical Tafl board. Carve your own path through a shifting, replayable New York filled with enemies, upgrades and hidden challenges.\n\n{1080712140816840}\n\n**Face towering enemies and mythical bosses**\n\nFight creatures drawn from Norse myth and beyond. Learn their patterns, unlock rune powers and adapt your strategy as the city breaks apart around you.\n\n{651329560692803}\n\n**Ascend with god-like powers**\n\nFind ancient runes, upgrade your abilities and build powerful loadouts across each session. The deeper you go, the stronger you become.\n\n**Wishlist now and be ready to wield the legendary Mjolnir!**", "short_description": "Wield the legendary Mjolnir and become a god in Street Gods, a physical VR action rogue-lite set in a fractured New York City where Norse realms have collided. Throw, recall, and slam the hammer with weight and precision in fast, impactful combat. Harness ancient power and fight to restore fate in a world spiralling into chaos.\n\nThink you\u2019ve got what it takes to wield the hammer and save the world? Jump In!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://soulassembly.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Soul Assembly", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.soulassembly.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id